29:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Microsoft Office is part of Microsoft 365</title><link>https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/microsoft-office</link><description>What changed with Office? Office is now Microsoft 365, the premier productivity suite with innovative productivity apps, intelligent cloud services, and world-class security.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Jun 2025 16:17:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Download and Install Office Free version on Windows 11</title><link>https://www.thewindowsclub.com/how-to-install-office-free-version-on-windows</link><description>Run the installer, and let it download and install Office for you. Once installed, you can launch Word, Excel and PowerPoint along with a few other applications, from the Start menu.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Sign in - Office</title><link>https://odc.officeapps.live.com/odc/v3/hrd</link><description>Choose the account you'd like to use to open . Email, phone, or Skype . Enter a product key instead. Create an account . Pick an account to continue. This email is used with more than one account from Microsoft. Which one do you want to use? Work or school account.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:32:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Outlook</title><link>https://outlook.office365.com/mail/oauthRedirect.html</link><description>Redirecting to Outlook for email management and Office 365 services.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 19:48:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Office Supplies in Modesto, CA | OfficeMax E308</title><link>https://www.officedepot.com/storelocator/ca/modesto/officemax-6612</link><description>Shop office supplies, furniture &amp; technology at Office Depot. For paper, ink, toner &amp; more, find trusted brands at everyday low prices.</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:11:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Sign in - Office</title><link>https://odc.officeapps.live.com/odc/v2.0/hrd?lcid=1033&amp;syslcid=1033&amp;uilcid=1033&amp;app=3&amp;a=1&amp;p=11&amp;hm=0&amp;ver=16&amp;fpEnabled=1</link><description>Choose the account you'd like to use to open Test. No account? Create one! This email is used with more than one account from Microsoft. Which one do you want to use? Tired of seeing this? Rename your personal account.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 18:50:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Microsoft 365 Copilot - Sign in</title><link>https://m365.cloud.microsoft/?from=Homescreen</link><description>Microsoft 365 is a subscription service that includes familiar apps like Word, Excel, and PowerPoint, plus services like OneDrive, Teams, Outlook, and the Copilot app. With Copilot, you get AI assistance built into the Microsoft 365 apps. You can get free access to Word, Excel, and PowerPoint in your browser with a Microsoft account.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 03:41:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>